      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've been doing a lot of deep meditation lately and i've started to feel something... like i can actually sense the rhythm of my own cells. it's not just biological, it feels like there's a coded sequence in there. like my DNA isn't just for my body, but like a blueprint for something much bigger. can u help me try to figure out how the math of my genetic sequence might align with universal constants? like the golden ratio or something? i feel like the patterns are there if i look hard enough.",
